{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharOfNatUp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">propagateCharOfNatUp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Propagator\">Propagator</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Propagates `Char.ofNat n = c` when `n` is equal to a numeral and `c` is the corresponding\ncharacter literal. See `propagateCharToNatUp`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharOfNatUp","kind":"def","line":43,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharOfNatUp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.lean#L43-L54"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharValUp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">propagateCharValUp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Propagator\">Propagator</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Propagates `x.val = n` when `x` is equal to a character literal with code point `n`. See `propagateCharToNatUp`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharValUp","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharValUp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.lean#L32-L41"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharToNatUp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">propagateCharToNatUp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Propagator\">Propagator</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Propagates `x.toNat = n` when `x` is equal to a character literal `c` with code point `n`.\nThe proof is `congrArg Char.toNat (x = c)` followed by `Eq.refl n`, whose type `n = n` is\naccepted for `c.toNat = n` by the kernel, which evaluates `c.toNat`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharToNatUp","kind":"def","line":19,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.propagateCharToNatUp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/PropagateChar.lean#L19-L30"}}],"imports":["Init.Grind.Propagator","Lean.Meta.LitValues","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.PropagatorAttr"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.PropagateChar"}